OL,3,GNEWSAIrish budget to tackle childcare
OL,4,Aand energy costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Irish government is expected to
OL,7,Fannounce measures to help with energy
OL,8,Fand childcare costs when it delivers
OL,9,Fits budget later.
OL,11,FThe threshold at which people start
OL,12,Fpaying the higher rate of income tax is
OL,13,Falso expected to be increased from its
OL,14,Fcurrent level of bB,44,000 (#37,000).
OL,16,FThe Taoiseach (Irish Prime Minister)
OL,17,FMicheal Martin said the budget has to
OL,18,Fbe about "trying to ease the pressure
OL,19,Fon families and households".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
