OL,3,GNEWSAIrish budget to tackle childcare
OL,4,Aand energy costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe broad shape of the budget was set
OL,7,Fout in the Summer Economic Statement,
OL,8,Fpromising tax measures worth bB,1.5bn
OL,9,F(#1.27bn) and extra spending of bB,7bn
OL,10,F(#5.92bn).
